1
00:00:00,439 --> 00:00:03,485
This is Outlay. Set a payment, and pay the person

2
00:00:03,496 --> 00:00:07,037
who settles it. You fund a room with canonical USDG,

3
00:00:07,284 --> 00:00:10,375
choose a recipient, and set a due time. When the

4
00:00:10,386 --> 00:00:13,873
room is due, any wallet can call settlement. The recipient

5
00:00:13,884 --> 00:00:16,674
gets the payout, and the caller receives a sender-funded bounty.

6
00:00:18,639 --> 00:00:22,716
Let's walk through a small, one-shot payment. This part reconstructs

7
00:00:22,726 --> 00:00:26,493
the interface flow; it does not send new transactions. Connect

8
00:00:26,504 --> 00:00:29,101
a wallet on Robinhood Chain, then select the existing Outlay

9
00:00:29,111 --> 00:00:33,125
deployment. The app checks its deployed runtime before enabling funding.

10
00:00:35,106 --> 00:00:38,935
Enter the recipient's address. Here, the payee receives zero point

11
00:00:38,946 --> 00:00:42,219
one USDG, and the caller earns zero point zero one.

12
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:47,005
Together, that's zero point one one USDG to lock. Choose

13
00:00:47,016 --> 00:00:50,160
due now for this walkthrough. The payout and the bounty

14
00:00:50,171 --> 00:00:51,502
are both funded by the sender.

15
00:00:53,473 --> 00:00:57,613
First, approve the room's funding amount. This authorizes the selected

16
00:00:57,624 --> 00:01:01,359
contract to move that amount of USDG. Approval alone doesn't

17
00:01:01,369 --> 00:01:04,825
create a room. Outlay waits for a successful receipt before

18
00:01:04,836 --> 00:01:05,930
offering the funding step.

19
00:01:07,873 --> 00:01:11,369
Now fund and open the room. After confirmation, it appears

20
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:14,288
in the settlement queue with the payee, payout, bounty, and

21
00:01:14,299 --> 00:01:17,583
remaining balance. A due room is ready for a caller.

22
00:01:18,323 --> 00:01:20,845
The contract holds the funds until settlement or an eligible

23
00:01:20,856 --> 00:01:21,350
refund.

24
00:01:23,306 --> 00:01:27,210
Click settle to execute the payment. A successful settlement transfers

25
00:01:27,221 --> 00:01:28,852
the payout to the payee and the bounty to the

26
00:01:28,863 --> 00:01:32,823
calling wallet. This one-shot room then closes with nothing remaining.

27
00:01:33,564 --> 00:01:36,375
The interface also compares the payee's token balance before and

28
00:01:36,386 --> 00:01:37,384
after the transaction.

29
00:01:39,339 --> 00:01:42,838
Here's the actual published payment, separate from the reconstructed walkthrough.

30
00:01:43,576 --> 00:01:46,334
On Robinhood Chain, room one was funded with zero point

31
00:01:46,345 --> 00:01:50,402
one one USDG. The recorded settlement paid zero point one

32
00:01:50,412 --> 00:01:52,419
to the payee and zero point zero one to the

33
00:01:52,430 --> 00:01:55,606
caller. The sender made this settlement call; this was not

34
00:01:55,617 --> 00:01:57,195
an independent keeper demonstration.

35
00:01:59,139 --> 00:02:02,273
The proof record links the deployment, room opening, and settlement

36
00:02:02,284 --> 00:02:06,489
transactions. Token transfer logs support both payments, and room one

37
00:02:06,499 --> 00:02:10,180
is closed with a zero remaining balance. Sourcify provides an

38
00:02:10,191 --> 00:02:14,011
exact source match for the deployment. The Blockscout verification badge

39
00:02:14,022 --> 00:02:14,977
remains incomplete.

40
00:02:16,939 --> 00:02:20,833
For recurring payments, choose funded periods and an interval. Three

41
00:02:20,844 --> 00:02:24,235
periods at these amounts require zero point three three USDG.

42
00:02:24,975 --> 00:02:27,776
Each successful settlement advances the next due time from that

43
00:02:27,787 --> 00:02:31,318
settlement. An external caller still has to submit a transaction,

44
00:02:31,554 --> 00:02:33,979
and the bounty does not guarantee a profit after gas.

45
00:02:35,939 --> 00:02:41,239
Outlay. Scheduled payments, paid settlement. Explore the app, inspect the

46
00:02:41,250 --> 00:02:43,417
